  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fAll_rights_reserved\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/assets license-All Rights Reserved-red.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"資產授權（保留所有權利）\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/KreloX/Gloves-For-All/blob/1.20.1/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-LGPL v3.0-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"程式碼授權（LGPL v3.0）\"> </a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmoddex.gg%252fmod%252faether-gloves-for-all\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://moddex.gg/badges/projects/aether-gloves-for-all/rating.svg?style=devin\" alt=\"ModDex 評分\"> </a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>🥊 關於這個擴充模組 🥊</strong></h2><p>「全民手套」擴充模組為選定的其他模組材料引入了手套變體。手套可以透過合成或與其他盔甲部件相同的方式獲得。現在，任何完整的套裝能力也都需要裝備手套才能生效（除非在 The Aether 的伺服器設定中停用）。</p><p>若要讓 Aether 與 Twilight Forest 相容，請使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/umbral-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Umbral Skies</a></p><h3><strong>支援以下模組：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/savage-and-ravage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Savage &amp; Ravage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreganized\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oreganized</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/galosphere\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galosphere</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Additions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simpleores\" rel=\"nofollow\">SimpleOres</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voidscape\" rel=\"nofollow\">Voidscape</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-midnight\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Midnight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/redstone-arsenal\" rel=\"nofollow\">Redstone Arsenal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftools-complement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tool's Complement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-cultivation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Cultivation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-innovation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Innovation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-extra\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Extra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism Tools</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire</a></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a37bc7ff0ce5bc39482171cc41d9c1825b7ad76e.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>☁️ 作者聲明 ☁️</strong></h2><p>「全民手套」是由 KreloX 開發的非官方擴充模組，與 The Aether 團隊無關。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252fkreloxkinetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://1drv.ms/i/c/6bf544900f9867ae/IQR3yxNMtle9S4RxniPeeGgMAVrcnQ4U65DGA1uiSdBUIbE?width=837&amp;height=80&amp;n=-1\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"> </a></p>",
